# Cursor AI Rules & Project Context — The Styer Team · Powered by GoRascal

## 1. Project Overview & Business Context
You are working on the production website codebase for **The Styer Team · Powered by GoRascal** (`styermortgage.com`).
- **Loan Officer**: Adam Styer, Individual NMLS #513013
- **Company / Corporate Entity**: Go Rascal Inc., Company NMLS #2072896, 185 Wythe Ave, Suite A2, Brooklyn, NY 11249
- **Austin Office**: 7600 N Capital of Texas Hwy, Suite 230, Office 105, Austin, TX 78731
- **Target Market**: Central Texas / Austin high-intent homebuyers, self-employed business owners (bank statements/1099/P&L), real estate investors (DSCR), jumbo/luxury buyers, and asset-depletion borrowers.
- **Tone & Voice**: Authentic, direct, personal, and authoritative first-person singular ("I structure...", "my team..."). Strictly avoid marketing fluff, hollow slogans, or stock-mortgage clichés.

---

## 2. Technical Stack & Architecture
- **Framework**: Static HTML5, modern vanilla CSS, and vanilla ES modules. Hosted on Netlify with continuous deployment from GitHub `main`.
- **Backend / Intake**: Netlify Functions (`netlify/functions/lead-intake.js`, `netlify/functions/admin.mts`, etc.) with LoanOS durable outbox capture.
- **Distribution Build**:
  - Source files are packaged into `.site-dist/` using: `node scripts/package-public-site.mjs`
  - Tests verify packaging integrity: `node tests/public-package.test.js`
  - Browser tests verify responsive forms and menus: `node tests/technical-repairs-browser.cjs`
- **Active Git Branch**: `design/private-wealth-editorial`
  - Main GitHub repository: `AStyer8345/styerteam-mortgage-site`

---

