## 4. Strict Guardrails & Working Rules
- **No Live Lead Submissions**: NEVER submit live leads or test forms to production endpoints during automated or manual browser QA.
- **Deep Guides Constraint**: Retain `noindex,follow` on the 34 detailed guides in `resources/detailed-guides/` per Adam's explicit instruction.
- **Asset Packaging**: Any image, script, or stylesheet added to public HTML must be tracked in Git or explicitly listed in `scripts/public-release-files.json`.
- **Preserve Legal Compliance**: All disclosures must cite Go Rascal Inc. (NMLS #2072896) and Adam Styer (NMLS #513013). Texas origination boundaries apply (do not imply personal origination outside Texas).
